Description: Generates synthetic clinical trial data for testing and development
    of clinical monitoring applications. Produces configurable multi-snapshot
    longitudinal datasets across SDTM-style and custom domains, with optional
    analytics and reporting pipelines powered by the 'workr' workflow engine.
